  "description": "The Chandrayaan2 Orbiter High Resolution Camera (OHRC) VHR (20cm/pix) local images of the Moon's surface. This dataset features a very-high-resolution calibrated images acquired by the OHRC, which operates onboard the Chandrayaan-2 lunar orbiter. The data went throuh geometric and radiometric calibration processes, which was done by ISRO. All of the data in this collection is sourced directly from the Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO), which is the primary owner of the data and has been processed for STAC access by Cloudferro.",
